{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14226880","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14226880","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1422688001:1":{"text":"Judging by your faces, I assume you got the essence?","source_cn":"各位，看你们的样子，应该获取到了纯净的土元素精华？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F06B0E06C9B4DD5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1422688002:1":{"text":"We didn't let you down.","source_cn":"幸不辱命。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB050587691072C5E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422688003:1":{"text":"With the familiars' aid, I've pinpointed the leyline nexus.","source_cn":"我在两位使魔的协助下，也找到了地脉节点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42604F5DBB91FAF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422688004:1":{"text":"Restoring the geo leyline might shift things. I've already asked Bryon to monitor the other nexuses—he'll alert us if anything goes wrong.","source_cn":"修复地脉后，此地可能会有一些变化。我已经安排了布莱恩在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D500D9F7333F63E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422688005:1":{"text":"The rest is up to you. It shouldn't be too difficult.","source_cn":"剩下的就交给你们了。此事并不难——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC35E14F5DF7079C6","variant_status":""